toolId=pan-card-resize dbTranslation={"toolSlug":"pan-card-resize","locale":"en","title":"PAN Card Resize","description":"Resize, crop, and format passport photos to official NSDL and UTIITSL PAN card specifications. Keep head spacing, check background rules, and stay under the 50KB limit.","faq":[{"question":"What is the photo size for PAN card applications?","answer":"The official photo size required by NSDL and UTIITSL portals is 3.5cm x 2.5cm, which translates to exactly 213 x 213 pixels (1:1 ratio) at 300 DPI."},{"question":"What background color is compliant for PAN card photos?","answer":"A white or light-colored plain background is strictly recommended for PAN card applications."},{"question":"Does it work on smartphones?","answer":"Yes. Our tool is optimized for mobile touch screens, including pinch gestures and drags."}],"seoTitle":"PAN Card Resize – Free Online Tool","seoDescription":"Format and resize passport photos to official NSDL/UTIITSL PAN card specifications."} lpFound=false lpTitle=undefined resolvedTitle=PAN Card Resize – Free Online Tool
toolId=merge-pdf dbTranslation={"toolSlug":"merge-pdf","locale":"en","title":"Merge PDF","description":"Combine multiple PDF documents into a single professional-grade file quickly and securely.","faq":[{"question":"Is it safe to merge confidential documents here?","answer":"Yes, it is 100% safe. Unlike other tools that upload your files to external servers, ToolWala AI processes your PDFs locally on your own computer. The files never travel across the internet, meaning your confidential data remains entirely yours."},{"question":"Is there a file size limit?","answer":"Since the merging is executed by your web browser, the size limit depends entirely on your device's available memory (RAM). Most modern computers and smartphones can easily merge files totaling up to 100MB or more without performance drops."},{"question":"Can I merge scanned images or password-protected PDFs?","answer":"You can merge standard PDFs and scanned PDF documents. However, if a PDF is encrypted or password-protected, you must decrypt or remove the password first, as client-side tools cannot read locked files without the password."},{"question":"Do I need to sign up or create an account?","answer":"No signup, registration, or email is required. You can merge your documents immediately and download the result for free, with no strings attached."}],"seoTitle":"Merge PDF Online – Combine PDF Files Free","seoDescription":"Combine multiple PDF files into one document quickly. No software installation required."} lpFound=false lpTitle=undefined resolvedTitle=Merge PDF Online – Combine PDF Files Free
toolId=merge-pdf dbTranslation={"toolSlug":"merge-pdf","locale":"en","title":"Merge PDF","description":"Combine multiple PDF documents into a single professional-grade file quickly and securely.","faq":[{"question":"Is it safe to merge confidential documents here?","answer":"Yes, it is 100% safe. Unlike other tools that upload your files to external servers, ToolWala AI processes your PDFs locally on your own computer. The files never travel across the internet, meaning your confidential data remains entirely yours."},{"question":"Is there a file size limit?","answer":"Since the merging is executed by your web browser, the size limit depends entirely on your device's available memory (RAM). Most modern computers and smartphones can easily merge files totaling up to 100MB or more without performance drops."},{"question":"Can I merge scanned images or password-protected PDFs?","answer":"You can merge standard PDFs and scanned PDF documents. However, if a PDF is encrypted or password-protected, you must decrypt or remove the password first, as client-side tools cannot read locked files without the password."},{"question":"Do I need to sign up or create an account?","answer":"No signup, registration, or email is required. You can merge your documents immediately and download the result for free, with no strings attached."}],"seoTitle":"Merge PDF Online – Combine PDF Files Free","seoDescription":"Combine multiple PDF files into one document quickly. No software installation required."} lpFound=false lpTitle=undefined resolvedTitle=Merge PDF Online – Combine PDF Files Free
